  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Counter Trafficking in Crisis in the Western Balkans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will increase capacity for proactive screening, victim identification, and services among vulnerable populations. The International Organization for Migration will conduct trainings for civil society and front-line officials to enhance TIP victim screening and identification. The project will provide services for victims and conduct public awareness campaigns among refugee and migrant populations to reduce vulnerability to TIP, including long-term vulnerability beyond initial arrival. This regional project also will include regional coordination meetings to improve cross-border coordination and referrals.</narrative>
  </description>
